1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,950
…Okay then.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,950
Six on one Groupon? Experience team?
Love it. Front row.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,950
Zip! Zap! —Hunter, it's ZOP—

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,700
Okay. This was a good call.

5
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:25,950
I know.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,950
Last one! Two people. First date. One
of you has a secret.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,950
Go!

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,950
So. What do you do?

9
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,692
I, uh— I own a company. A big one. And
everybody who works there thinks I'm

10
00:00:50,742 --> 00:00:51,950
somebody else.

11
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,950
Oh yeah? And what happens if they find
out?

12
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,950
I think…

13
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,950
…the one person I actually like would
stop looking at me like that.

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,950
Awww—

15
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,950
And scene!

16
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,950
To Abby. Who refuses to let us be sad.

17
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,950
To Abby!

18
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,950
Be right back.

19
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,950
…Mr. Cole?
